$$\text{Explanation:}\n\text{Step 1: Recall the definition of Homo sapiens.}\n\text{Step 2: Identify the characteristics of Homo sapiens.}\n\text{Step 3: Choose the correct answer.}$$', '["They are herbivores", "They are carnivores", "They are omnivores", "They are bipedal"]', 'They are omnivores', 'Step 1: Recall the definition of Homo sapiens.
